---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Deccan Realtors | Trusted Real Estate Advisory"
  description="Learn about Deccan Realtors' philosophy of research-backed advisory, exhaustive due diligence, and curated opportunities led by Ahmed Saif Ali Khan."
>
  <div class="bg-brand-950 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-brand-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-accent-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Our Story & Ethos</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-display tracking-tight">About Deccan Realtors</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl">
        Building generational wealth through research-backed advisory, zero sales bias, and verified real estate opportunities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-900 font-display">
          Pioneering Informed Real Estate Decisions
        </h2>
        <p>
          Deccan Realtors was founded on a simple yet vital premise: real estate decisions are among the most significant financial commitments an individual or institution ever makes. They should never be driven by aggressive salesmanship, but by verified market intelligence and legal transparency.
        </p>
        <p>
          We help clients evaluate macro-economic growth drivers, micro-market infrastructure developments, and developer delivery records to curate property investments that deliver enduring value.
        </p>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-accent-500 pl-4 py-2 italic text-slate-800 font-medium">
          "Deccan Realtors help people make informed real-estate decisions: across Nagpur and Dubai through trusted advisory, market intelligence, due diligence, and carefully curated property and investment opportunities."
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8 border border-slate-200">
        <img src="https://hpssqssdewmkmafxlfud.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/public-assets/logos/93c65dee-87a5-48e3-a2d2-406182a33b37/deccan_realtors_93c65dee-87a5-48e3-a2d2-406182a33b37_1787575176651.png" alt="Deccan Realtors" class="w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl object-contain mb-6 border border-slate-100" />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-1">Ahmed Saif Ali Khan</h3>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-accent-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">CEO, Deccan Realtors</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "Our objective is to deliver unmatched peace of mind. Every property featured in our portfolio undergoes rigorous legal scrutiny and market validation before we present it to our clients."
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
          <span>Official Email:</span>
          <span class="text-brand-900 font-bold">ceo@deccanrealtors.com</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
